Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Kikkun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.74,0:00:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs20\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.5\pos(134.4,251.733)}Which Means It's an OOPArt, datsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.72,0:00:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,How's it going? Selling well?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Kikkun and Tsuntsun, running a booth together?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.64,0:00:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you selling, tsun?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.44,0:00:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,OOPArts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.72,0:00:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen OOPArts treated so casually before!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.85,0:00:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, is it okay to sell OOPArts at a handmade flea market like this, tsun?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.94,0:00:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.90,0:00:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you only allowed to sell things you made yourself, tsun?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.14,0:00:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,THAT'S WHY these are OOPArts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.06,0:00:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So? Eh? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.49,0:00:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsun! Ah, I see! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.20,0:00:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs16\pos(192,34.133)\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H69&}OOPArts are artifacts with technology that completely defies the era and place they were discovered in, tsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.71,0:00:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's said that those weren't made by humans, but by aliens, tsun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.47,0:00:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right. Things made by aliens. \NThat means they are OOPArts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.11,0:00:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,OOPArts where you can see \Nthe producer's face, tsun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.03,0:00:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.41,0:00:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether it's vegetables or OOPArts, \Nconsumer trust is important, tsun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.02,0:00:52.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh times, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.82,0:00:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.37,0:00:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a madeleine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.52,0:01:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I feel like you see these often at handmade flea markets, 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.48,0:01:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,but isn't this not an OOPArt?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.21,0:01:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,A madeleine made by an alien. 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.17,0:01:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs16\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H69&\pos(180.8,285.156)}That's an OOPArt.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.52,0:01:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.02,0:01:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,, It's a 3rd-turn turnip.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.68,0:01:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely this isn't! 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.07,0:01:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,A 3rd-turn turnip made by an alien! 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.07,0:01:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs16\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H69&\pos(180.267,285.867)}That's an OOPArt!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.37,0:01:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnFredoka\b1\fs25\1c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\bord0.5\pos(195.733,108.8)}Some hours later....
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.16,0:01:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not selling at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.60,0:01:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They're OOPArts though. 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.15,0:01:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Are OOPArts just not trendy right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.24,0:01:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should try icing cookies next.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.96,0:01:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, those look nice, so they might sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.68,0:01:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's hoping for an OOPArt boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.70,0:01:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope it does well.
